# skkuverse-server origin.
#
# REQUIRED as of skkuverse#17 — the ESKARA notification feed at /eskara/inbox is
# the first page here that fetches, and Vite substitutes this at BUILD time, so a
# Cloudflare Pages build without it produces a bundle that can only ever render
# the failed state. Nothing fails at build or in CI; it fails in the browser, on
# the device, for everyone.
#
# The server must also allow this app's origin in CORS_ORIGINS
# (skkuverse-server src/infra/origins.ts). Both halves, or the page reads nothing.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.skkuverse.com
